    approvalId ApprovalId (0..1) <"An identifer for a specific appoval, to allow the approval to be identified and tracked.">
    portfolioReference PortfolioReferenceBase (0..1) <"A reference structure identifying the portfolio to which the response message relates within the applicable messaging process.">
    tradePackage TradePackage (0..1) <"A structured collection of related trades grouped under a common package. It includes a package header for metadata, multiple trade instances or references, and optional elements for allocations and approvals. This element facilitates efficient management of complex trading strategies, block trades, or multi-leg transactions by encapsulating all relevant trade details within a single package.">
